{"seq":3,"slug":"web-to-app-routing","title":"Web-to-App 路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation/web-to-app-routing","wordCount":1157,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"web-to-app-路由\">Web-to-App 路由</h1><p>从网页发起 App 跳转是深链最常见的场景之一，涵盖广告落地页、邮件营销、社交媒体分享等。网页端需要判断 App 是否已安装、选择合适的跳转方式，以及在 App 未安装时提供优雅的降级体验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>隐私限制</strong>：浏览器无法直接查询 App 是否已安装，Web-to-App 路由必须依赖超时检测或系统级方案（Universal Links / App Links）来推断跳转是否成功</li>\n<li><strong>Universal Links 优先</strong>：配置正确的 Universal Links / App Links 是最优雅的方案——App 已安装时直接打开，未安装时自然降级到网页，无需任何 JavaScript 处理</li>\n<li><strong>Intent URL（Android）</strong>：<code>intent://path#Intent;scheme=...;package=...;S.browser_fallback_url=...;end</code> 格式允许在 Chrome 中精确控制跳转行为和降级 URL，比超时检测更可靠</li>\n<li><strong>社交媒体内嵌浏览器</strong>：微信、QQ 等 App 的内置 WebView 通常屏蔽 URI Scheme 和 Universal Links 跳转，需要通过 UA 检测引导用户在外部浏览器中打开</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"web-to-app-的核心挑战\">Web-to-App 的核心挑战</h2><p>浏览器环境无法直接查询 App 是否安装（隐私限制），也无法知道 URI Scheme 跳转是否成功。因此 Web-to-App 路由本质上是一套基于超时和降级的启发式方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[网页链接点击] --&gt; B{Universal Links / App Links?}&#10;    B --&gt;|已配置且已安装| C[系统直接打开 App]&#10;    B --&gt;|未安装或未配置| D[降级到网页]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Smart Banner 提示安装]&#10;    E --&gt; F{用户选择}&#10;    F --&gt;|安装 App| G[App Store]&#10;    F --&gt;|留在网页| H[网页内容]\">graph LR\n    A[网页链接点击] --&gt; B{Universal Links / App Links?}\n    B --&gt;|已配置且已安装| C[系统直接打开 App]\n    B --&gt;|未安装或未配置| D[降级到网页]\n    D --&gt; E[Smart Banner 提示安装]\n    E --&gt; F{用户选择}\n    F --&gt;|安装 App| G[App Store]\n    F --&gt;|留在网页| H[网页内容]</pre><h2 id=\"universal-links-与-app-links-的降级优先策略\">Universal Links 与 App Links 的降级优先策略</h2><p>配置正确的 Universal Links（iOS）和 App Links（Android）是 Web-to-App 路由的首选方案。当用户点击 <code>https://example.com/product/123</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>App 已安装且验证通过 → 直接打开 App</li>\n<li>App 未安装 → 正常打开网页（无任何错误提示）</li>\n<li>App 已安装但验证未通过 → 打开网页或弹出选择器</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这是最用户友好的方式，开发者无需编写任何 JavaScript 跳转逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"smart-banner-苹果智能横幅\">Smart Banner（苹果智能横幅）</h2><p>iOS Safari 支持通过 <code>&lt;meta&gt;</code> 标签在网页顶部显示 App 下载横幅：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;head&gt;&#10;  &lt;meta name=&quot;apple-itunes-app&quot; content=&quot;app-id=123456789, app-argument=https://example.com/product/123&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/head&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">head</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apple-itunes-app\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"app-id=123456789, app-argument=https://example.com/product/123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">head</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>app-argument</code> 参数会作为 Universal Link URL 传递给 App，实现跳转到指定页面。</p>\n<p><strong>Smart Banner 的局限性：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅在 iOS Safari 显示，Chrome 和 Android 不支持</li>\n<li>用户可以关闭横幅，且关闭后不再显示</li>\n<li>外观固定，无法自定义样式</li>\n</ul>\n<p>替代方案是自定义 JavaScript 横幅，可以在所有浏览器中显示：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function showCustomAppBanner(deepLinkUrl) {&#10;  const isIOS = /iPhone|iPad|iPod/.test(navigator.userAgent);&#10;  const isAndroid = /Android/.test(navigator.userAgent);&#10;&#10;  if (!isIOS &amp;&amp; !isAndroid) return; // 桌面端不显示&#10;&#10;  const banner = document.createElement(&#39;div&#39;);&#10;  banner.innerHTML = `&#10;        &lt;div class=&quot;app-banner&quot;&gt;&#10;            &lt;span&gt;在 App 内获得更好体验&lt;/span&gt;&#10;            &lt;a href=&quot;${deepLinkUrl}&quot;&gt;打开 App&lt;/a&gt;&#10;            &lt;a href=&quot;${getStoreUrl()}&quot;&gt;下载&lt;/a&gt;&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    `;&#10;  document.body.prepend(banner);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> showCustomAppBanner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">deepLinkUrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isIOS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">iPhone</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">iPad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">iPod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(navigator.userAgent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isAndroid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">Android</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(navigator.userAgent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">isIOS </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">isAndroid) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 桌面端不显示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> banner</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'div'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  banner.innerHTML </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        &#x3C;div class=\"app-banner\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            &#x3C;span>在 App 内获得更好体验&#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            &#x3C;a href=\"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">deepLinkUrl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\">打开 App&#x3C;/a></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            &#x3C;a href=\"${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getStoreUrl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">()</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\">下载&#x3C;/a></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    `</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  document.body.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(banner);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"javascript-深链跳转的完整方案\">JavaScript 深链跳转的完整方案</h2><p>当需要通过 JavaScript 触发 URI Scheme 跳转时，必须处理&quot;App 未安装&quot;的降级场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function openDeepLink(scheme, fallbackUrl) {&#10;  const start = Date.now();&#10;&#10;  // 尝试通过自定义 Scheme 打开 App&#10;  window.location = scheme;&#10;&#10;  // 设置超时检测：如果 App 打开成功，页面会切换，这段代码不会执行&#10;  // 如果 App 未安装，页面保持，超时后触发降级&#10;  setTimeout(function () {&#10;    // 检查是否还在当前页面（页面失去焦点说明 App 已打开）&#10;    if (Date.now() - start &lt; 2500) {&#10;      window.location = fallbackUrl;&#10;    }&#10;  }, 2000);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用示例&#10;openDeepLink(&#39;myapp://product/detail?id=123&#39;, &#39;https://example.com/product/123&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> openDeepLink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scheme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fallbackUrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 尝试通过自定义 Scheme 打开 App</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window.location </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scheme;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 设置超时检测：如果 App 打开成功，页面会切换，这段代码不会执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 如果 App 未安装，页面保持，超时后触发降级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 检查是否还在当前页面（页面失去焦点说明 App 已打开）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      window.location </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fallbackUrl;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openDeepLink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'myapp://product/detail?id=123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://example.com/product/123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个方案的问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>超时时间难以精准设置（设备性能差异大）</li>\n<li>iOS Safari 在 App 未安装时会弹出错误对话框</li>\n<li>部分浏览器会拦截非用户主动触发的 window.location 修改</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"android-intent-url\">Android Intent URL</h2><p>Android 的 <code>intent://</code> URL 是比自定义 Scheme 更可靠的 Web-to-App 方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 在 Android Chrome 中使用 Intent URL --&gt;&#10;&lt;a&#10;  href=&quot;intent://product/detail?id=123#Intent;&#10;    scheme=myapp;&#10;    package=com.example.app;&#10;    S.browser_fallback_url=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com%2Fproduct%2F123;&#10;    end&quot;&#10;&gt;&#10;  在 App 中打开&#10;&lt;/a&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 在 Android Chrome 中使用 Intent URL --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"intent://product/detail?id=123#Intent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    scheme=myapp;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    package=com.example.app;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    S.browser_fallback_url=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com%2Fproduct%2F123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    end\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  在 App 中打开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>Intent URL 参数说明：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>scheme</code></td>\n<td>URI Scheme</td>\n<td><code>myapp</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>package</code></td>\n<td>App 包名</td>\n<td><code>com.example.app</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>S.browser_fallback_url</code></td>\n<td>App 未安装时的降级 URL（URL 编码）</td>\n<td><code>https%3A%2F%2F...</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>action</code></td>\n<td>Intent Action（可选）</td>\n<td><code>android.intent.action.VIEW</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>category</code></td>\n<td>Intent Category（可选）</td>\n<td><code>android.intent.category.BROWSABLE</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>S.browser_fallback_url</code> 是关键参数，Chrome 在未找到对应 App 时会自动导航到这个 URL，避免了超时检测的复杂性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨浏览器兼容方案\">跨浏览器兼容方案</h2><p>不同浏览器对深链跳转的支持差异显著：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>浏览器</th>\n<th>iOS Universal Links</th>\n<th>Android App Links</th>\n<th>Intent URL</th>\n<th>自定义 Scheme</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Safari（iOS）</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>支持（弹错误提示）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chrome（iOS）</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chrome（Android）</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Firefox（Android）</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>支持度较低</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微信内置浏览器</td>\n<td>阻断</td>\n<td>阻断</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>微信、QQ 等社交 App 的内置浏览器通常屏蔽了自定义 Scheme 和 Universal Links 跳转。针对这类场景，常见处理方式是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>检测 User-Agent 中的微信标识（<code>MicroMessenger</code>）</li>\n<li>显示&quot;请用 Safari/Chrome 打开&quot;提示</li>\n<li>或通过微信开放平台的应用宝方案跳转</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function isWechat() {&#10;  return /MicroMessenger/i.test(navigator.userAgent);&#10;}&#10;&#10;if (isWechat()) {&#10;  showWechatOpenInBrowserTip();&#10;} else {&#10;  openDeepLink(appScheme, fallbackUrl);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isWechat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">MicroMessenger</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(navigator.userAgent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isWechat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  showWechatOpenInBrowserTip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  openDeepLink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(appScheme, fallbackUrl);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"短链服务与重定向链\">短链服务与重定向链</h2><p>营销场景中常使用短链（Short URL）服务，短链服务器根据 User-Agent 智能路由：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant User as 用户设备&#10;    participant Short as 短链服务&#10;    participant iOS as Apple App Store&#10;    participant Android as Google Play&#10;    participant Web as 网页落地页&#10;&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;Short: 点击 https://go.example.com/abc123&#10;    Short-&gt;&gt;Short: 解析 UA,判断平台&#10;    alt iOS + App 已安装&#10;        Short-&gt;&gt;User: 302 → Universal Link&#10;    else iOS + App 未安装&#10;        Short-&gt;&gt;User: 302 → App Store 链接&#10;    else Android + App 已安装&#10;        Short-&gt;&gt;User: 302 → Android App Link&#10;    else Android + App 未安装&#10;        Short-&gt;&gt;User: 302 → Play Store 链接&#10;    else 桌面端&#10;        Short-&gt;&gt;User: 302 → Web 落地页&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户设备\n    participant Short as 短链服务\n    participant iOS as Apple App Store\n    participant Android as Google Play\n    participant Web as 网页落地页\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;Short: 点击 https://go.example.com/abc123\n    Short-&gt;&gt;Short: 解析 UA,判断平台\n    alt iOS + App 已安装\n        Short-&gt;&gt;User: 302 → Universal Link\n    else iOS + App 未安装\n        Short-&gt;&gt;User: 302 → App Store 链接\n    else Android + App 已安装\n        Short-&gt;&gt;User: 302 → Android App Link\n    else Android + App 未安装\n        Short-&gt;&gt;User: 302 → Play Store 链接\n    else 桌面端\n        Short-&gt;&gt;User: 302 → Web 落地页\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Web-to-App 路由的优先级策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>首选 Universal Links / App Links</strong>：无需 JavaScript，用户体验最佳，App 未安装时自动降级到网页，应作为主要方案</li>\n<li><strong>Android Intent URL 作为 Chrome 补充</strong>：在需要控制降级行为时使用，<code>S.browser_fallback_url</code> 参数提供精确的 fallback 控制</li>\n<li><strong>超时检测方案慎用</strong>：2 秒超时难以覆盖所有设备和网络环境，iOS Safari 在 Scheme 未安装时弹出错误对话框，用户体验差</li>\n<li><strong>微信等内嵌浏览器单独处理</strong>：检测 <code>MicroMessenger</code> UA 后展示&quot;请在外部浏览器中打开&quot;提示，或使用应用宝等平台化方案</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章相关文档：</strong> <a href=\"ios-deep-linking-implementation\">iOS 深链实现</a> 和 <a href=\"android-deep-linking-implementation\">Android 深链实现</a> 分别介绍 App 端接收深链后的处理逻辑。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Web-to-App 路由","id":"web-to-app-路由"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Web-to-App 的核心挑战","id":"web-to-app-的核心挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"Universal Links 与 App Links 的降级优先策略","id":"universal-links-与-app-links-的降级优先策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Smart Banner（苹果智能横幅）","id":"smart-banner-苹果智能横幅"},{"level":2,"text":"JavaScript 深链跳转的完整方案","id":"javascript-深链跳转的完整方案"},{"level":2,"text":"Android Intent URL","id":"android-intent-url"},{"level":2,"text":"跨浏览器兼容方案","id":"跨浏览器兼容方案"},{"level":2,"text":"短链服务与重定向链","id":"短链服务与重定向链"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Android 深链实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation/android-deep-linking-implementation"},"next":{"title":"深链测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering/deep-link-testing"}}